{"labs": [{"_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn11le03ob07re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Boris</span>: Have you studied the monthly sales report, Denise?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Denise</span>: No, how does it look?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Boris</span>: It would appear that your sales pitch has finally taken off. We have seen a 200% increase in sales in the financial literacy workbooks since last month.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Denise</span>: Excellent!\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Boris</span>: This is more good news. The marketing department has informed me that the number of requests for presentations has increased dramatically. There is also a message from a local bank president who has expressed an interest in becoming a corporate sponsor.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Denise</span>: That's great news.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn11le03ob07re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Boris</span>: You know, it would be a good idea to evaluate our strategies. What worked well? What didn't work very well? What changes to the pitch or other factors made a difference?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Denise</span>: Yes. That's a good idea, because talking about it now will help me give feedback at the next board meeting.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Boris</span>: From my perspective, I think we have had more success through the direct marketing approach. We were more successful when we contacted the end users -- the parents or teachers -- not the bureaucrats in the school board or the Department of Education.", "id": 2, "time": "33500", "image": "engenn11le03ob07re2img06.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Denise</span>: I agree. We also have been more successful since I worked on the pitch. I geared it towards the specific needs of the consumer, rather than to our own track record. People became enthusiastic because I was able to summarize their problems even before they had the chance to express them.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Boris</span>: We explained \u201cthe fit\u201d.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Denise</span>: Right. It seems our investment in focus groups has helped a lot to understand the market.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Boris</span>:  Although direct marketing is powerful, don't forget that we combined that with our online campaign including podcasts and using social media. Our Twitter feed is a lot more active than before, because people are asking questions and engaging in conversation directly with the authors.", "id": 3, "time": "66500", "image": "engenn11le03ob07re2img07.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn11le03ob07re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn11le03ob07re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}], "exercises": [{"id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0], "questions": [], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " I can talk about the present result of events that started in the past in work and job issues.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can discuss reasons and results of an event or an action related to work and jobs.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can explain arguments supporting different points of view.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " What improvements have you made at work?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " What did they help you do better?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " What other improvements would you like to make?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2, "attempt_feedback