t": "Integrates factual information to a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge in the workplace.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of a complex text on both concrete and abstract topics, including technical issues in a specific field of specialization in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of a complex text on both concrete and abstract topics, including technical issues in a specific field of specialization in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of a complex text on both concrete and abstract topics, including technical issues in a specific field of specialization in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of a complex text on both concrete and abstract topics, including technical issues in a specific field of specialization in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of a complex text on both concrete and abstract topics, including technical issues in a specific field of specialization in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Integrates factual information to a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge in the workplace.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of a complex text on both concrete and abstract topics, including technical issues in a specific field of specialization in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "fit", "type": "name"}, {"content": "connection between a product and the needs of a customer", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We explained \u201cthe fit\u201d with our product.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn11le03ob07aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use when you talk about selling a product or service.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "corporate sponsor", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a large company who pays money to be associated with an event or a product", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: There is also a message from a local bank president who has expressed an interest in becoming a corporate sponsor.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn11le03ob07aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "bureaucrat", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a person who works for a government institution", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We were more successful when we contacted the end users, not the bureaucrats in the school board.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn11le03ob07aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "school board", "type": "name"}, {"content": "in North America, a way of organizing schools into districts with local control", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: There are twenty-five school boards in our state.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn11le03ob07aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "end user", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the person or group who will buy and use a product or service", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It's important to reach the end users of the product.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn11le03ob07aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to gear ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to orient or direct something in a certain way, for a particular reason", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I geared the pitch more towards the specific needs of the consumer, rather than to our own track record.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn11le03ob07aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "sales report", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a document outlining the revenue", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Have you studied the monthly sales report, Denise?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn11le03ob07aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "engenn11le03ob07re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " The Present Perfect Tense: Commenting on Results", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the Present Perfect tense when you want to talk about a past event that has a connection to the present.  <br/>This is especially useful when you want to talk about the present results of a past situation or event.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You can use the verbs <span class=\"italic\">appear</span>,<span class=\"italic\"> seem </span>and <span class=\"italic\">sound </span>to comment on the present results of something in the past.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "For example:<br/><span class=\"italic\">It <span class=\"strong\">appears </span>as if <span class=\"strong\">he has already decided </span>to take the job.</span> <br/> <span class=\"italic\">It <span class=\"strong\">sounds </span>like <span class=\"strong\">they have been </span>promoted to team leaders.</span> <br/> <span class=\"italic\">She <span class=\"strong\">seems </span>as though <span class=\"strong\">she has been </span>awake for days.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "It would appear that your sales pitch has finally taken off.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "It seems our investment in focus groups has helped a lot to understand the market. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "It sounds like we have had more success through the direct marketing approach.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " Reason Clauses with Because and Since", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " You can introduce the reason for something happening with clauses. This makes your speaking or writing more dynamic.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You can introduce reasons with the words <span class=\"italic\">because </span>and <span class=\"italic\">since</span>. <br/> <span class=\"italic\">Since </span>is often placed at the beginning of a sentence. <span class=\"italic\">Because </span>is usually placed between two clauses.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Look at the chart for details:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Word\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Use\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">because</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to answer the question <span class=\\\"italic\\\">Why</span>?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I didn't finish the report <span class=\\\"strong\\\">because </span>I had other priorities.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">since</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" introduces a reason that the listener or reader already knows\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Since </span>you don't know how to use this machine, let's try something else.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "That's a good idea, because talking about it now will help me give feedback at the next board meeting.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Since the sales pitch is so good now, we can expect more success in the future.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "People became enthusiastic because I was able to summarize their problems even before they had the chance to express them.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Make a list of the sales strategies mentioned in this lesson.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "With a partner, discuss other sales strategies. Add them to your list.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Go online. Add more ideas to your list. Try to come up with a total of 10 ideas.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Do a role-play of a business meeting. Give the ideas as ways to improve sales.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I write a list of strategies to improve sales.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I read and discuss strategies to improve sales.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I give suggestions for sales in a role-play of a business meeting.", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "sena"}